{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban unsolicited marketing or doorstep cold calling and scams",
        "additional_details": "We call on the government to introduce legislation that makes unsolicited doorstep selling & cold calling a criminal offense. Every year, thousands mainly the elderly, isolated, and vulnerable are targeted on their own doorsteps by rogue traders, aggressive salespeople, and sophisticated scammers. Home should be a safe haven, yet we believe it has become a hunting ground for exploitative financial practices. In our view \"No Cold Calling\" zones and window stickers offer a minor deterrent, they lack strict legal teeth.",
        "background": "Ban all forms of unsolicited doorstep marketing and commercial cold calling to protect consumers, with a specific focus on safeguarding elderly and vulnerable individuals from what we believe can be predatory sales tactics and scams.",
